:question/id #uuid "20010f38-3e5e-5e3e-a89d-c3c51d40861a"] ["question-20010f38-3e5e-5e3e-a89d-c3c51d40861a" :question/math-academy-id "q-20989"] ["question-20010f38-3e5e-5e3e-a89d-c3c51d40861a" :question/problem "![](images/0b/0bd043f0ff9b6cc575d7912776bd0aaa41dc161b32304115cf6c8dedba86f81a.png)\n\nFor the parametric curve (shown above)\n\n$$\nx=3\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t,\\,y=4\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t,\\,0\\le t<2\\pi ,\n$$\n\n find the derivative $\\frac{dy}{dx}$ at the point $P$ on the curve where $t=\\frac{\\pi }{8}.$"] ["question-20010f38-3e5e-5e3e-a89d-c3c51d40861a" :question/worked-solution "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(t)}{{x}^{′}(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=6\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t,\\,{y}^{′}(t)=-8\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{-8\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t}{6\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t}=-\\frac{4}{3}\\operatorname{tan}⁡2t.\n$$\n\nAt the point where $t=\\frac{\\pi }{8}$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =-\\,\\frac{4}{3}\\cdot \\operatorname{tan}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{8}) \\\\  & =-\\,\\frac{4}{3}\\cdot \\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =-\\,\\frac{4}{3}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =-\\,\\frac{4}{3}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-20010f38-3e5e-5e3e-a89d-c3c51d40861a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-ce157c42-a9a4-5ec7-af0b-682ed5561091" :answer-field/id #uuid "ce157c42-a9a4-5ec7-af0b-682ed5561091"] ["answer-f37683f8-f240-5221-9235-386d2ba6e331" :answer/id #uuid "f37683f8-f240-5221-9235-386d2ba6e331"] ["answer-f37683f8-f240-5221-9235-386d2ba6e331" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f37683f8-f240-5221-9235-386d2ba6e331" :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}"] ["answer-98cc3f2f-f840-5de8-acdb-83f201a4880d" :answer/id #uuid "98cc3f2f-f840-5de8-acdb-83f201a4880d"] ["answer-98cc3f2f-f840-5de8-acdb-83f201a4880d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-98cc3f2f-f840-5de8-acdb-83f201a4880d" :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{4}"] ["answer-389a5696-c840-56e0-8558-733de5240472" :answer/id #uuid "389a5696-c840-56e0-8558-733de5240472"] ["answer-389a5696-c840-56e0-8558-733de5240472" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-389a5696-c840-56e0-8558-733de5240472" :answer/value "-\\frac{4}{3}"] ["answer-aaab6afb-3ab3-5a9f-849c-a2ad0e12fb8e" :answer/id #uuid "aaab6afb-3ab3-5a9f-849c-a2ad0e12fb8e"] ["answer-aaab6afb-3ab3-5a9f-849c-a2ad0e12fb8e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-aaab6afb-3ab3-5a9f-849c-a2ad0e12fb8e" :answer/value "-\\frac{4}{7}"] ["answer-4017febd-50d6-5503-af7a-ff948aace873" :answer/id #uuid "4017febd-50d6-5503-af7a-ff948aace873"] ["answer-4017febd-50d6-5503-af7a-ff948aace873" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4017febd-50d6-5503-af7a-ff948aace873" :answer/value "-\\frac{7}{4}"] ["answer-field-ce157c42-a9a4-5ec7-af0b-682ed5561091" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-ce157c42-a9a4-5ec7-af0b-682ed5561091" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-ce157c42-a9a4-5ec7-af0b-682ed5561091" :answer-field/correct "answer-389a5696-c840-56e0-8558-733de5240472"] ["answer-field-ce157c42-a9a4-5ec7-af0b-682ed5561091" :answer-field/choices "answer-f37683f8-f240-5221-9235-386d2ba6e331"] ["answer-field-ce157c42-a9a4-5ec7-af0b-682ed5561091" :answer-field/choices "answer-98cc3f2f-f840-5de8-acdb-83f201a4880d"] ["answer-field-ce157c42-a9a4-5ec7-af0b-682ed5561091" :answer-field/choices "answer-389a5696-c840-56e0-8558-733de5240472"] ["answer-field-ce157c42-a9a4-5ec7-af0b-682ed5561091" :answer-field/choices "answer-aaab6afb-3ab3-5a9f-849c-a2ad0e12fb8e"] ["answer-field-ce157c42-a9a4-5ec7-af0b-682ed5561091" :answer-field/choices "answer-4017febd-50d6-5503-af7a-ff948aace873"] ["question-20010f38-3e5e-5e3e-a89d-c3c51d40861a" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-ce157c42-a9a4-5ec7-af0b-682ed5561091"] [17592186083240 :knowledge-point/questions "question-20010f38-3e5e-5e3e-a89d-c3c51d40861a"] ["question-ef5ed0c9-8fa3-5025-804c-fe51ae9e2b6d" :question/id #uuid "ef5ed0c9-8fa3-5025-804c-fe51ae9e2b6d"] ["question-ef5ed0c9-8fa3-5025-804c-fe51ae9e2b6d" :question/math-academy-id "q-15477"] ["question-ef5ed0c9-8fa3-5025-804c-fe51ae9e2b6d" :question/problem "For the parametric curve \n\n$$\nx={sec}^{2}⁡t,\\,y={csc}^{3}⁡t,\\,0<t<\\frac{\\pi }{2},\n$$\n\ncalculate the slope of the tangent to the curve at the point where $t=\\frac{\\pi }{4}.$"] ["question-ef5ed0c9-8fa3-5025-804c-fe51ae9e2b6d" :question/worked-solution "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(t)}{{x}^{′}(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=2{sec}^{2}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,{y}^{′}(t)=-3{csc}^{3}⁡t\\operatorname{cot}⁡t.\n$$\n\n \n\nSo we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{-3{csc}^{3}⁡t\\operatorname{cot}⁡t}{2{sec}^{2}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t} \\\\  & =-3{csc}^{3}⁡t\\operatorname{cot}⁡t(\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡t\\operatorname{cot}⁡t}{2}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{2}\\,{csc}^{3}⁡t{cot}^{2}⁡t{cos}^{2}⁡t \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{2}(\\frac{1}{{sin}^{3}⁡t})(\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡t}{{sin}^{2}⁡t}){cos}^{2}⁡t \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{2}(\\frac{{cos}^{4}⁡t}{{sin}^{5}⁡t}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{2}\\,\\operatorname{csc}⁡t{cot}^{4}⁡t\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, when $t=\\frac{\\pi }{4},$ the slope of the tangent to the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =-\\frac{3}{2}\\,\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}){cot}^{4}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{2}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{2}}\\, \\\\  & =-\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-ef5ed0c9-8fa3-5025-804c-fe51ae9e2b6d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] ["answer-field-940ee680-1c54-57c6-9fe1-a296cc68c0ad" :answer-field/id #uuid "940ee680-1c54-57c6-9fe1-a296cc68c0ad"] ["answer-5348801e-a631-5d23-93d5-012769dd8d19" :answer/id #uuid "5348801e-a631-5d23-93d5-012769dd8d19"] ["answer-5348801e-a631-5d23-93d5-012769dd8d19" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-5348801e-a631-5d23-93d5-012769dd8d19" :answer/value "-2"] ["answer-b432d866-9d8e-5893-a7c9-658ab974d99b" :answer/id #uuid "b432d866-9d8e-5893-a7c9-658ab974d99b"] ["answer-b432d866-9d8e-5893-a7c9-658ab974d99b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b432d866-9d8e-5893-a7c9-658ab974d99b" :answer/value "-\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}"] ["answer-0825b7a7-74a7-5935-86cd-1b0bba712bd3" :answer/id #uuid "0825b7a7-74a7-5935-86cd-1b0bba712bd3"] ["answer-0825b7a7-74a7-5935-86cd-1b0bba712bd3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-0825b7a7-74a7-5935-86cd-1b0bba712bd3" :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}"] ["answer-d843b8af-69d9-5879-a337-8dde5a272ce0" :answer/id #uuid "d843b8af-69d9-5879-a337-8dde5a272ce0"] ["answer-d843b8af-69d9-5879-a337-8dde5a272ce0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d843b8af-69d9-5879-a337-8dde5a272ce0" :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}"] ["answer-600a5309-7bc1-513f-8449-5d85d2a64fd0" :answer/id #uuid "600a5309-7bc1-513f-8449-5d85d2a64fd0"] ["answer-600a5309-7bc1-513f-8449-5d85d2a64fd0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-600a5309-7bc1-513f-8449-5d85d2a64fd0" :answer/value "-\\sqrt{2}"] ["answer-field-940ee680-1c54-57c6-9fe1-a296cc68c0ad" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-940ee680-1c54-57c6-9fe1-a296cc68c0ad" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-940ee680-1c54-57c6-9fe1-a296cc68c0ad" :answer-field/correct "answer-b432d866-9d8e-5893-a7c9-658ab974d99b"] ["answer-field-940ee680-1c54-57c6-9fe1-a296cc68c0ad" :answer-field/choices "answer-5348801e-a631-5d23-93d5-012769dd8d19"] ["answer-field-940ee680-1c54-57c6-9fe1-a296cc68c0ad" :answer-field/choices "answer-b432d866-9d8e-5893-a7c9-658ab974d99b"] ["answer-field-940ee680-1c54-57c6-9fe1-a296cc68c0ad" :answer-field/choices "answer-0825b7a7-74a7-5935-86cd-1b0bba712bd3"] ["answer-field-940ee680-1c54-57c6-9fe1-a296cc68c0ad" :answer-field/choices "answer-d843b8af-69d9-5879-a337-8dde5a272ce0"] ["answer-field-940ee680-1c54-57c6-9fe1-a296cc68c0ad" :answer-field/choices "answer-600a5309-7bc1-513f-8449-5d85d2a64fd0"] ["question-ef5ed0c9-8fa3-5025-804c-fe51ae9e2b6d" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-940ee680-1c54-57c6-9fe1-a296cc68c0ad"] [17592186083243 :knowledge-point/questions "question-ef5ed0c9-8fa3-5025-804c-fe51ae9e2b6d"] ["question-08b30b3b-db11-543f-b5eb-089393bd6bb2" :question/id #uuid "08b30b3b-db11-543f-b5eb-089393bd6bb2"] ["question-08b30b3b-db11-543f-b5eb-089393bd6bb2" :question/math-academy-id "q-15470"] ["question-08b30b3b-db11-543f-b5eb-089393bd6bb2" :question/problem "For the parametric curve \n\n$$\nx={e}^{t}-{e}^{-t},\\,y=t{e}^{t},\\,-\\infty <t<\\infty ,\n$$\n\ncalculate the slope of the tangent to the curve at the point where $t=0.$"] ["question-08b30b3b-db11-543f-b5eb-089393bd6bb2" :question/worked-solution "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(t)}{{x}^{′}(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)={e}^{t}+{e}^{-t},\\,{y}^{′}(t)=(t+1){e}^{t}.\n$$\n\n \n\nSo we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{(t+1){e}^{t}}{{e}^{t}+{e}^{-t}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1+t}{1+{e}^{-2t}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, when $t=0,$ the slope of the tangent to the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{1+0}{1+{e}^{-0}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-08b30b3b-db11-543f-b5eb-089393bd6bb2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-a897637f-a103-5c3f-81b6-65711f8a97e5" :answer-field/id #uuid "a897637f-a103-5c3f-81b6-65711f8a97e5"] ["answer-d226f22a-73aa-5bd5-8ffb-659b107ef567" :answer/id #uuid "d226f22a-73aa-5bd5-8ffb-659b107ef567"] ["answer-d226f22a-73aa-5bd5-8ffb-659b107ef567" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d226f22a-73aa-5bd5-8ffb-659b107ef567" :answer/value "2"] ["answer-6098c79c-346b-5248-8398-6ba51720d41a" :answer/id #uuid "6098c79c-346b-5248-8398-6ba51720d41a"] ["answer-6098c79c-346b-5248-8398-6ba51720d41a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6098c79c-346b-5248-8398-6ba51720d41a" :answer/value "3"] ["answer-f869162a-a3a8-5474-8b17-6aeb207f63c0" :answer/id #uuid "f869162a-a3a8-5474-8b17-6aeb207f63c0"] ["answer-f869162a-a3a8-5474-8b17-6aeb207f63c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f869162a-a3a8-5474-8b17-6aeb207f63c0" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}"] ["answer-4238841a-e6fd-5b61-9bb7-9b81cecfd441" :answer/id #uuid "4238841a-e6fd-5b61-9bb7-9b81cecfd441"] ["answer-4238841a-e6fd-5b61-9bb7-9b81cecfd441" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4238841a-e6fd-5b61-9bb7-9b81cecfd441" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}"] ["answer-58c5d980-f308-55bb-b6dc-33f198a88f15" :answer/id #uuid "58c5d980-f308-55bb-b6dc-33f198a88f15"] ["answer-58c5d980-f308-55bb-b6dc-33f198a88f15" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-58c5d980-f308-55bb-b6dc-33f198a88f15" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}"] ["answer-field-a897637f-a103-5c3f-81b6-65711f8a97e5" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-a897637f-a103-5c3f-81b6-65711f8a97e5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-a897637f-a103-5c3f-81b6-65711f8a97e5" :answer-field/correct "answer-f869162a-a3a8-5474-8b17-6aeb207f63c0"] ["answer-field-a897637f-a103-5c3f-81b6-65711f8a97e5" :answer-field/choices "answer-d226f22a-73aa-5bd5-8ffb-659b107ef567"] ["answer-field-a897637f-a103-5c3f-81b6-65711f8a97e5" :answer-field/choices "answer-6098c79c-346b-5248-8398-6ba51720d41a"] ["answer-field-a897637f-a103-5c3f-81b6-65711f8a97e5" :answer-field/choices "answer-f869162a-a3a8-5474-8b17-6aeb207f63c0"] ["answer-field-a897637f-a103-5c3f-81b6-65711f8a97e5" :answer-field/choices "answer-4238841a-e6fd-5b61-9bb7-9b81cecfd441"] ["answer-field-a897637f-a103-5c3f-81b6-65711f8a97e5" :answer-field/choices "answer-58c5d980-f308-55bb-b6dc-33f198a88f15"] ["question-08b30b3b-db11-543f-b5eb-089393bd6bb2" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-a897637f-a103-5c3f-81b6-65711f8a97e5"] [17592186083243 :knowledge-point/questions "question-08b30b3b-db11-543f-b5eb-089393bd6bb2"] ["question-df476431-ab3a-5147-98f8-ef5f1e16d04c" :question/id #uuid "df476431-ab3a-5147-98f8-ef5f1e16d04c"] ["question-df476431-ab3a-5147-98f8-ef5f1e16d04c" :question/math-academy-id "q-353353"] ["question-df476431-ab3a-5147-98f8-ef5f1e16d04c" :question/problem "![](images/85/853358cc3207d3f2738ecc3bd2ee6391d62b1a51735c43e16f37a2b83414800e.png)\n\nFor the parametric curve \n\n$$\nx=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3t+1),\\,y=t{e}^{t},\\,-\\frac{1}{3}<t<\\infty ,\n$$\n\nshown above, calculate the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve at the point where $t=0.$ Do not round the answer.\n\n$m=$ \n{{field-1}}"] ["question-df476431-ab3a-5147-98f8-ef5f1e16d04c" :question/worked-solution "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(t)}{{x}^{′}(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=\\frac{3}{3t+1},\\,{y}^{′}(t)=(t+1){e}^{t}.\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{(t+1){e}^{t}}{(\\frac{3}{3t+1})} \\\\  & =\\frac{(t+1)(3t+1){e}^{t}}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, when $t=0,$ the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m=\\frac{dy}{dx}\\,{|}_{t\\,=\\,0} & =\\frac{(0+1)(0+1){e}^{0}}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-df476431-ab3a-5147-98f8-ef5f1e16d04c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-8b9a1810-6a6d-5eb5-883e-8d03107298a3" :answer-field/id #uuid "8b9a1810-6a6d-5eb5-883e-8d03107298a3"] ["answer-e9f8b02c-3c71-509f-93de-e4a3c2bb07cb" :answer/id #uuid "e9f8b02c-3c71-509f-93de-e4a3c2bb07cb"] ["answer-e9f8b02c-3c71-509f-93de-e4a3c2bb07cb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e9f8b02c-3c71-509f-93de-e4a3c2bb07cb" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}"] ["answer-field-8b9a1810-6a6d-5eb5-883e-8d03107298a3" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-8b9a1810-6a6d-5eb5-883e-8d03107298a3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-8b9a1810-6a6d-5eb5-883e-8d03107298a3" :answer-field/correct "answer-e9f8b02c-3c71-509f-93de-e4a3c2bb07cb"] ["answer-field-8b9a1810-6a6d-5eb5-883e-8d03107298a3" :answer-field/choices "answer-e9f8b02c-3c71-509f-93de-e4a3c2bb07cb"] ["question-df476431-ab3a-5147-98f8-ef5f1e16d04c" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-8b9a1810-6a6d-5eb5-883e-8d03107298a3"] [17592186083243 :knowledge-point/questions "question-df476431-ab3a-5147-98f8-ef5f1e16d04c"]] "retractions" []}]